      "card_ids": ["C06"],
      "claim": "Hernandezine, a related isoquinoline alkaloid, achieved brain Cmax nearly equal to plasma Cmax after intravenous dosing in rats, supporting effective CNS access for this alkaloid class.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C08"],
      "claim": "Corydaline was detected in CSF and reached brain levels close to other tissues after oral dosing in rats, providing direct evidence that tetrahydroisoquinoline-type alkaloids penetrate the BBB.",
